# 统一行尾为 LF。
# 本仓库在 WSL/Linux 运行，CRLF 会导致 shell 脚本
# "bad interpreter"、Dockerfile 构建失败与 Python 断言差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.sqlite binary
*.whl binary
